{"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"alias":"goldfilled-portly-dungbeetle","creation_channel":"mcp","description":"## Context / Problem\nThe infra/nginx cohort contains audited comments or docstrings that obscure current behavior with repetition, obvious narration, duplicated explanation, or historical detail. The audit is pinned to `9e65567b79ffe872534c3c656ade7b34340d8192`.\n\n## Approach\nEdit explanatory text only in this directory/subsystem cohort. Condense it to current, non-obvious rationale and constraints; retain every file-specific preserve item and consumer contract below. Grouping adjacent files from one subsystem keeps the change reviewable in one session and permits one coherent verification pass without changing executable behavior.\n\n## Scope\n- `infra/nginx/mcp-upstream.conf:1-12` — Preserve committed seed, generated live include, host-nginx glob consumer, safe default upstream. Consumer: nginx/materializer.\n- `infra/nginx/rebar.conf.template:1-37,44-53,89-201,249-300` — Preserve TLS/HSTS, switchable MCP upstream, literal forwarded scheme, prefix/redirect rewriting, op-cert guard, SSE buffering/timeouts, RFC 9728 metadata, Gerrit proxy behavior. Consumer: nginx/operators/security review.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] Every listed location contains only current, non-obvious rationale or constraints after remediation; verified by reviewing the final diff against every Scope row.\n- [ ] Every preserve item and consumer contract in Scope remains explicit and accurate; verified by a row-by-row completion comment and the commands under Verification.\n- [ ] No executable behavior or test assertion changes; verified by the commands under Verification exiting 0.\n\n## Verification\n- `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" make lint`\n\nThe row-by-row diff review is authoritative for prose quality; the hygiene guard detects only its narrow deterministic history-token rule.","id":"36f4-ae53-2199-42c1","parent_id":"49ac-d7e5-f383-4d7f","priority":3,"repos":["rebar"],"tags":["comments","documentation","maintainability","grouped-remediation"],"ticket_type":"task","title":"Condense comments in infra/nginx"},"env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","event_type":"CREATE","timestamp":1788570509261138566,"uuid":"4e6e21c8-cd3b-4ebb-9bb2-6836a933dc8c"}